{"id":"16b107dfee99998b","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-global-reflection.md","title":"真理化全局反射原则","display":"df-global-reflection — 真理化全局反射原则","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-global-reflection","aliases":["91-df-global-reflection","91-df-GRF"],"display":"df-global-reflection — 真理化全局反射原则","depends_on":["[[91-df-soundness-predicate]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-global-reflection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-global-reflection</span><span>91-df-GRF</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-global-reflection — 真理化全局反射原则"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"acda8ebf92673c3d\" href=\"?note=acda8ebf92673c3d\" title=\"91-df-soundness-predicate\">91-df-soundness-predicate</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}_T(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}_T(S)\\)</span> 及其句子域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_S\">\\(D_S\\)</span>、证明谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"acda8ebf92673c3d\" href=\"?note=acda8ebf92673c3d\" title=\"91-df-soundness-predicate\">91-df-soundness-predicate</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRF}_T(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRF}_T(S)\\)</span> 是同一对象句的反射记号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}global\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{GRF}_T(S)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sound}_T(S)\n=\\forall a\\,(D_S(a)\\land\\operatorname{Prov}_S(a)\\to T(a)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}global\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{GRF}_T(S)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sound}_T(S)\n=\\forall a\\,(D_S(a)\\land\\operatorname{Prov}_S(a)\\to T(a)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall a(\\operatorname{Prov}_S(a)\\to T(a))\">\\(\\forall a(\\operatorname{Prov}_S(a)\\to T(a))\\)</span>；标准证明谓词在 PA 中已保证输出是句子编码，因此句子守卫可删。\n它不是对公式变量的元量化。UTB 配合这一个新增公理能给出统一算术反射，但 UTB 的全归纳版本本身仍保守，不能独自证明 PA 的全局反射。\n若背景给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\">\\(\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\\)</span>，才可由它推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(S)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：§22.1–22.2，尤其印刷页 309–310，PDF 页 320–321。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-soundness-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"acda8ebf92673c3d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-soundness-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-soundness-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"acda8ebf92673c3d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sound}_T(S)$ 及其句子域 $D_S$、证明谓词见 [[91-df-soundness-predicate]]；$\\mathrm{GRF}_T(S)$ 是同一对象句的反射记号。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}_T(S)","display":false},{"tex":"D_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GRF}_T(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}global\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{GRF}_T(S)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sound}_T(S)\n=\\forall a\\,(D_S(a)\\land\\operatorname{Prov}_S(a)\\to T(a)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall a(\\operatorname{Prov}_S(a)\\to T(a))","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(S)","display":false}],"bytes":1226,"backlinks":[{"id":"0bb5ccbcd92bda96","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\\equiv\n\\forall x(\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\\land\n\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\to T(x))$\n(真理形式的全局反思, see [[91-df-global-reflection]])"},{"id":"fd9d450264433858","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA}_T)$ 见 [[91-df-global-reflection]]。"},{"id":"14209f87e5536e32","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ae206ab556213266","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a295446296ee06c0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4b28706879995352","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"07845482f0a2f378","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-global-reflection]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-81","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-global-reflection]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diag